# Date and time rules for Chinese (zh-CN). The vocabulary below is matched character by character (there are no spaces to cut words at);
# the grammar that joins numbers and the characters 年 月 日 号 点 时 分 半 刻 is code. Reference: Wednesday 2026-03-18 gives
# 下周五 = 2026-03-27, 周一 = 2026-03-23 (a bare weekday is the next one, today counting), 明年春天 = 2027-03-01 to 2027-06-01.

# Days relative to the reference day: forms | days from today [| the part of the day the word names].
[zh.relday]
今天, 今日 | 0
明天, 明日 | 1
后天 | 2
大后天 | 3
昨天, 昨日 | -1
前天 | -2
大前天 | -3
今晚 | 0 | evening
昨晚, 昨夜 | -1 | evening
明晚 | 1 | evening
今早 | 0 | morning
明早 | 1 | morning

# Periods relative to now: forms | unit | offset. "weekday" rows are the prefixes of a weekday (下周五 is 下 + 周五).
[zh.relperiod]
今年, 本年, 本年度 | year | 0
明年, 来年 | year | 1
去年 | year | -1
前年 | year | -2
后年 | year | 2
本月, 这个月, 这月, 当月 | month | 0
下个月, 下月, 下一个月 | month | 1
上个月, 上月, 上一个月 | month | -1
本周, 这周, 本星期, 这星期, 这个星期, 本礼拜, 这个礼拜, 这一周 | week | 0
下周, 下星期, 下个星期, 下礼拜, 下个礼拜, 下一周 | week | 1
上周, 上星期, 上个星期, 上礼拜, 上个礼拜, 上一周 | week | -1
本季度, 这个季度, 本季 | quarter | 0
下个季度, 下季度 | quarter | 1
上个季度, 上季度 | quarter | -1
这个, 这, 本 | weekday | 0
下个, 下 | weekday | 1
上个, 上 | weekday | -1

[zh.weekday]
1 | 周一, 星期一, 礼拜一
2 | 周二, 星期二, 礼拜二
3 | 周三, 星期三, 礼拜三
4 | 周四, 星期四, 礼拜四
5 | 周五, 星期五, 礼拜五
6 | 周六, 星期六, 礼拜六
7 | 周日, 周天, 星期日, 星期天, 礼拜日, 礼拜天

# Seasons are the meteorological ones of the northern hemisphere (spring March to May); winter starts in December of the year named.
[zh.season]
spring | 春天, 春季 | 3 | 3
summer | 夏天, 夏季 | 6 | 3
autumn | 秋天, 秋季 | 9 | 3
winter | 冬天, 冬季 | 12 | 3

# Parts of the day: name | forms | start hour | end hour | how an hour written with it is read (am, pm, noon, night, evening).
[zh.daypart]
dawn | 凌晨 | 0 | 6 | night
morning | 早上, 早晨, 清晨, 一早 | 6 | 9 | am
forenoon | 上午 | 6 | 12 | am
noon | 中午 | 11 | 13 | noon
afternoon | 下午 | 12 | 18 | pm
evening | 晚上, 晚间, 夜晚, 傍晚 | 18 | 24 | evening

# Units of time: name | forms | seconds | months | the unit a duration is counted in.
[zh.unit]
second | 秒钟, 秒 | 1 | 0 | Second
minute | 分钟 | 60 | 0 | Minute
quarterhour | 刻钟 | 900 | 0 | Minute
hour | 小时, 个小时, 钟头, 个钟头 | 3600 | 0 | Hour
day | 天 | 86400 | 0 | Day
week | 周, 个星期, 星期, 个礼拜, 礼拜, 个周 | 604800 | 0 | Week
month | 个月 | 0 | 1 | Month
year | 年 | 0 | 12 | Year
businessday | 个工作日, 工作日 | 0 | 0 | BusinessDay

# Zones named in text: forms | offset in minutes [| z for UTC]. There is no time zone database: a name is a fixed offset.
[zh.zone]
北京时间, 北京标准时间, 中国标准时间, 东八区时间 | 480
东京时间, 日本时间 | 540
格林尼治时间, 格林威治时间, UTC, GMT | 0 | z

# Holidays. Fixed days and computed ones use the rules of the other languages; the lunar ones read the pinned table below.
[zh.holiday]
元旦, 元旦节 | fixed 01-01
情人节 | fixed 02-14
妇女节, 三八妇女节 | fixed 03-08
植树节 | fixed 03-12
愚人节 | fixed 04-01
劳动节, 国际劳动节 | fixed 05-01
青年节 | fixed 05-04
儿童节, 六一儿童节 | fixed 06-01
建军节 | fixed 08-01
教师节 | fixed 09-10
国庆节, 国庆日 | fixed 10-01
万圣节 | fixed 10-31
平安夜 | fixed 12-24
圣诞节 | fixed 12-25
母亲节 | nth 2 sun 5
父亲节 | nth 3 sun 6
感恩节 | nth 4 thu 11
复活节 | easter 0
春节, 大年初一 | lunar chunjie
除夕 | lunar chunjie -1
元宵节 | lunar chunjie 14
清明节 | lunar qingming
端午节 | lunar duanwu
中秋节 | lunar zhongqiu

# Dates of the lunar-calendar holidays, one list per holiday, pinned by year. Spring Festival (lunar 1/1), Dragon Boat (lunar 5/5) and
# Mid-Autumn (lunar 8/15) follow the lunar calendar as published in the yearly State Council notices; Qingming is the solar term near
# April 4 or 5. Outside these years the holiday is not resolved.
[zh.lunar]
chunjie | 2022-02-01, 2023-01-22, 2024-02-10, 2025-01-29, 2026-02-17, 2027-02-06, 2028-01-26, 2029-02-13, 2030-02-03
qingming | 2022-04-05, 2023-04-05, 2024-04-04, 2025-04-04, 2026-04-05, 2027-04-05, 2028-04-04, 2029-04-04, 2030-04-05
duanwu | 2022-06-03, 2023-06-22, 2024-06-10, 2025-05-31, 2026-06-19, 2027-06-09, 2028-05-28, 2029-06-16, 2030-06-05
zhongqiu | 2022-09-10, 2023-09-29, 2024-09-17, 2025-10-06, 2026-09-25, 2027-09-15, 2028-10-03, 2029-09-22, 2030-09-12
